  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.316,
      "end": 3.655,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "现在是酷暑难当，野浪翻涌啊！",
      "score": 0.3719,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.6706,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.422,
        "seg_cer": 0.333,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "text_free": "现在是枯楚难挡，夜浪翻涌啊！",
        "dur": 3.339,
        "n_char": 12,
        "text_check": "建议校对"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 3.655,
      "end": 11.237,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "当南来的暑气直抒八平的时候，寻一处清凉绿洲就成了大家迫切的渴望。",
      "score": 0.2325,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.4074,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.183,
        "seg_cer": 0.3,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "text_free": "江南的楚七，词书八平的时候，寻的一处清凉庐州，就成了大家迫切的渴望。",
        "dur": 7.582,
        "n_char": 30,
        "text_check": "建议校对"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 11.503,
      "end": 16.009,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "在临川县山盖镇的陆江村的群山怀抱处，",
      "score": 0.3298,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.4073,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.183,
        "seg_cer": 0.294,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.4,
        "phon_examples": "山/三 临/陵",
        "text_free": "在陵川县三街镇的路江村的群山环抱处。",
        "dur": 4.506,
        "n_char": 17,
        "text_check": "建议校对"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 16.009,
      "end": 20.3,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "藏着一片名为十八湾的田园碧处秘境。",
      "score": 0.7113,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.3616,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.5,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.125,
        "phon_examples": "藏/唱",
        "text_free": "唱到一篇名为《十八弯》的田言，逼出秘经。",
        "dur": 4.291,
        "n_char": 16,
        "text_check": "建议校对"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 20.613,
      "end": 28.859,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "这里的山水繁茂、碧波清冽，成为了市民游客逃离酷暑、寻觅野趣的清凉胜地。",
      "score": 0.0442,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0278,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.097,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "text_free": "这里的山水环绕，碧波清冽，成为了市民游客逃离酷暑、寻觅野趣的清凉圣地。",
        "dur": 8.246,
        "n_char": 31
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 28.982,
      "end": 35.403,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "陆江村委地处峡谷腹地，陆江河蜿蜒流淌，河道迂回，两岸葱郁，",
      "score": 0.1549,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0134,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.12,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.667,
        "phon_examples": "陆/怒 陆/怒",
        "text_free": "怒江城委地处峡谷腹地，怒江河蜿蜒流淌，河道迂回，两岸葱郁。",
        "dur": 6.421,
        "n_char": 25
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 35.723,
      "end": 38.402,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "沿途碧潭、浅潭星罗棋布。",
